  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "A01",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "朋友托您办的事，没办成，那个电话，您是不是拖了好几天不敢打？",
      "chars": 30,
      "speech_ms": 5280,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 5280,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A02",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "人情这东西，靠的是平时一点点往来处出来的——《中国式人情世故》里讲的，就是这个理。",
      "chars": 41,
      "speech_ms": 8230,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 5680,
      "end_ms": 13910,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A03",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "托人办事，我自己就记住三步：早回、说透、给路。",
      "chars": 23,
      "speech_ms": 5940,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 14310,
      "end_ms": 20250,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A04",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "早回：有结果当天就说，别等人家追着问；您越躲，对方心里越凉。",
      "chars": 30,
      "speech_ms": 6640,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 20650,
      "end_ms": 27290,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A05",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "说透：卡在哪一步，明明白白讲，不推给别人，也不夸海口说下次一定。",
      "chars": 32,
      "speech_ms": 8010,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 27690,
      "end_ms": 35700,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A06",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "给路：这条路走不通，帮他想想还有没有别的门路，哪怕只是提个醒，也比一句「没办法」强。",
      "chars": 42,
      "speech_ms": 8380,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 36100,
      "end_ms": 44480,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A07",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "办成办不成是能力，肯不肯及时回话是人品。",
      "chars": 20,
      "speech_ms": 4080,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 44880,
      "end_ms": 48960,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A08",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "这本书我放在主页橱窗里了，点开我主页，商品橱窗里就有。",
      "chars": 27,
      "speech_ms": 5450,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 49360,
      "end_ms": 54810,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A09",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "办不成的事，您一般怎么跟人开口？",
      "chars": 16,
      "speech_ms": 2850,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 55210,
      "end_ms": 58060,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    }
  ]
}